{"id":448,"name":"lucario","speciesId":448,"dex":448,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["fighting","steel"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":110,"defense":70,"special-attack":115,"special-defense":70,"speed":90},"abilities":[{"name":"steadfast","hidden":false},{"name":"inner-focus","hidden":false},{"name":"justified","hidden":true}],"height":12,"weight":540,"baseExp":184,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/448.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/448.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/448.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/448.ogg","genus":"Aura Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It has the ability to sense the auras of all things. It understands human speech."},{"version":"pearl","text":"By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements."},{"version":"platinum","text":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see."},{"version":"black-2","text":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away."},{"version":"sun","text":"Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle."},{"version":"moon","text":"They can detect the species of a living being— and its emotions—from over half a mile away. They control auras and hunt their prey in packs."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It concentrates its mental energy and fires off mysterious waves called auras, which can crush boulders of large size to dust."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Lucario reads its opponent’s feelings with its aura waves. It finds out things it would rather not know, so it gets stressed out easily."},{"version":"sword","text":"It controls waves known as auras, which are powerful enough to pulverize huge rocks. It uses these waves to take down its prey."},{"version":"shield","text":"It can tell what people are thinking. Only Trainers who have justice in their hearts can earn this Pokémon’s trust."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power."}],"genderRate":1,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["ground","humanshape"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"riolu","speciesId":447,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Felicidade alta, De dia"],"species":"lucario","speciesId":448,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":448,"name":"lucario","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/448.png"},{"id":10059,"name":"lucario-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10059.png"},{"id":10310,"name":"lucario-mega-z","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10310.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24,25],"moves":[{"id":5,"learn":[[20,"tm",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":14,"learn":[[8,"lv",33],[8,"tm",0],[9,"lv",33],[9,"tm",0],[10,"lv",33],[10,"tm",0],[11,"lv",37],[11,"tm",0],[14,"lv",37],[14,"tm",0],[15,"lv",19],[15,"tm",0],[16,"lv",19],[16,"tm",0],[17,"lv",19],[17,"tm",0],[18,"lv",19],[18,"tm",0],[20,"lv",40],[20,"tm",0],[23,"lv",